      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WITHOUT A TRACE (7) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from four tries. In the money last time at Q Parklands (41.55) in a OPEN, finishing a 1.75 lengths third. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. IN BLOOM (1) flew the lids off the inside draw with a fast early split and gave a sight, finishing a 4.5 lengths third (43.12) over 730m at The Meadows. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Bold showing expected. MEPUNGA BREEZE (4) has a strong record here with three wins and four placings from nine starts. Below best last time at The Meadows (42.92) in a Special conditions G3, finishing a 7 length fifth. Can hit the frame with the right run. PAW LOVISA (6) won as expected last time and is in the mix again.",
